            <ArticleTitle>Escape from true stent jail by use of the rotablator.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>99-101</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe the use of the Rotablator device to allow sidebranch access via the side-wall of a stent when it has proved impossible to pass even the lowest profile balloon catheter through the struts N a situation of &quot;true stent jail&quot;.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
